'''Maree''' was a female [[human]] who lived on [[At Attin]] during the [[New Republic Era]] with her wife [[Garree]] and their daughter [[KB]].<ref name="Very Interesting" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Maree first appeared in "[[Very Interesting, As an Astrogation Problem]]" the third episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'',<ref name="Very Interesting" /> which aired on [[December 10]], [[2024]].<ref name="Release">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1861409832349172011|''[[Star Wars]]''|date=2024-11-26|quote=Mark your calendars. 🗓️ On December 2, stream the two-episode series premiere of #SkeletonCrew, only on @DisneyPlus.|archiveurl=https://ghostarchive.org/archive/uxgSx|archivefile=File:StarWars-SkeletonCrewSchedule-Twitter.png}}</ref>

